(Ingredia helps you review packaged food products against your personal allergy or ) Tj
T*
(intolerance profile.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Scan a barcode, fetch product information, compare it with your active profile, and get ) Tj
T*
(a clearer view of what needs extra attention. When relevant data is available, Ingredia ) Tj
T*
(can also suggest better alternatives from the same or a similar category.) Tj
T*
() Tj
